Package: maffect
Title: Manhattan Plots with Effect Sizes, Allele Frequency and Genes
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Andrew", "Elmore", , "andrew.elmore@bristol.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Draws an enhanced GWAS Manhattan plot. Alongside the usual
    -log10(P) skyline it shows each locus's effect size and its uncertainty on
    an aligned track beneath the chromosome axis, encodes minor allele
    frequency so that rare and common variant signals can be read on the same
    figure, and labels lead variants with their nearest gene (or any label you
    supply). Built on 'ggplot2' with a clean, modern theme.
